Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we've got a lot of\Nonly children in our group, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.79,0:00:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have an older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Only child" "Only child"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have an older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Only child" "Only child"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Also only children"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But the biggest shock of them all\Nis that Shu's an older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--A sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,--A brother?\N--A sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--A brother?\N--Or a sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--A brother?\N--A brother?\N--Or a sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,--A brother?\N--A sister?\N--Or a sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--A brother?\N--A sister?\N--Or a brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Calm down, he doesn't have that many!\N--Or a brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--Calm down, he doesn't have that many!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I only found out when I went over\Nto Shu's house not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, three years younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally figured his\Nlittle sister would be all...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tee-hee! Welcome home, big bwuther!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They look pretty similar,\Nbut she wasn't all that friendly with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. Can't believe Iura's a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.95,0:01:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a big bwuther...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.33,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pretty chill outside of school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup, my dudes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get ourselves burgerfied\Nafter school, whaddya think?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better start\Nacting more responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.95,0:03:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"\N"It May Seem Like Hate"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"\N"It May Seem Like Hate"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Psych! Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Student Council Room"\N"It May Seem Like Hate"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Shu, you're such a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"It May Seem Like Hate"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Shu, you're such a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Shu, you're such a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Iura-kun is quite the comedian, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yanagi-kun,\Nwhy do you always talk so formally?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've been super polite\Nto us ever since the day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I suppose it's just habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're real casual with Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagin, "bye-bye"!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagin! Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,B... Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohmigod, you said it! You're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remi-Remi, I don't know if I should\Nbe impressed or weirded out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting, Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayasaki-san's messing with Yanagi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you guys heading home? Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.79,0:04:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye. See you, Yanagi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Yanagi, why don't you start\Ncalling everyone by their first name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll call you Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's times like these that I get really\Njealous of Iura's peppy personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Everyone wants to be\Ncloser friends with Yanagi"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's times like these that I get really\Njealous of Iura's peppy personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Everyone wants to be\Ncloser friends with Yanagi"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use my first name, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use my first name, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never called a friend\Nby their first name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it will come easily to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop using your polite voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:04:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--No more formal talk, starting now!\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--No more formal talk, starting now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.58,0:05:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Owie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop bothering Yanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, he's certainly not bothering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I... Well, I can assure you,\Nnot even {\i1}I {\i0}appreciate the fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.70,0:05:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...that I keep such distance between\Nmyself and others with my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd like to become closer friends\Nwith Ishikawa-kun and Miyamura-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.66,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And of course, all the rest of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on in here?\NThis is quite the odd bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"SQUEEZE"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"SQUEEZE"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Yanagi, we weren't friends with\Nthis guy here until recently, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"SQUEEZE"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"SQUEEZE"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But look how close we\Nare now! Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But look how close we\Nare now! Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.45,0:05:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, you couldn't pay me\Nto do that with the Prez.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They managed to creep out Iura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite the feat,\NIshikawa-kun, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sengoku! We're good buds now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to be best buds right away, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are n--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course we're best buds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.83,0:06:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm best buds with all\Nof you, Yanagi-kun, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--For real! Let's finish 'im\Noff with a wrestling move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.75,0:06:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Guys are so weird.\NI'm gonna go follow Yuki.\N--For real! Let's finish 'im\Noff with a wrestling move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, no wrestling holds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Best buds...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Best buds can settle any argument\Nwith rock-paper-scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blatantly lie to him, Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.37,0:06:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! The poor prez always loses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose way more than I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not {\i1}that {\i0}bad at\Nrock-paper-scissors, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose every time we decide\Nwho goes to the vending machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then I'll win next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I\Ncalled you "Toru," Ishikawa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What about me? What about {\i1}me{\i0}, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One at a time! Please,\Nlet me do this one at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I wanna be next!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna start calling him Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be weird if I were the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could,\NI just need a bit of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagi-kun might be on my\Npersonal blacklist, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why?! Why's he on your blacklist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.79,0:07:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a very funny joke, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Take what away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he gonna take from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did he already take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Argh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Argh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Argh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a big dummy, Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And there he goes.\NWhat the heck was he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanagi looks happy 'bout it, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I told you, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kono-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kono-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taller than him by a little, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the same height, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you two fighting or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! Akane just said he got taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And Miyamura-kun said I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}are {\i0}fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, because I'm taller than Akane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I told him neither of us are 170\Ncentimeters tall, and he got all mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That was uncalled for, Miyamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And you shouldn't have\Nblown up at him either, Yanagi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You beat me to apologizing! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.04,0:09:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely fair. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.37,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad the two of them\Nare such close friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawada, how do you feel about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you've gotten a lot\Nbetter with guys lately, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we're your friends,\Nnot inanimate objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.16,0:09:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just wanted to see how\Ncomfortable Sawada's getting with guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle up to Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hori-senpai -> Girls -> Miyamura -> Boys\N[Ishikawa -> Sengoku ->\NShindo -> Iura (Yanagi?)]"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.20,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle up to Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Hori-senpai -> Girls -> Miyamura -> Boys\N[Ishikawa -> Sengoku ->\NShindo -> Iura (Yanagi?)]"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where do I rank, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ishikawa: Nice. Talks to me."\N"Sengoku: Easy to talk to."\N"Iura: Loud. Like, really loud. And annoying."\NWait, where do I rank, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ishikawa: Nice. Talks to me."\N"Sengoku: Easy to talk to."\N"Iura: Loud. Like, really loud. And annoying."\NSweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some snacks here, Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You like chocolate, Sawada-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have all of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, she's eatin' them\Nright outta my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--Just you wait.\NI'll shake up that tier list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--What the heck...\N--Just you wait.\NI'll shake up that tier list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.41,0:10:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Iura-kun, not a peep! Stay quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.00,0:10:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Sorry, I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.37,0:10:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sawada-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.95,0:10:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! C'mon, now,\NSawada-san, it's me, Iura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Iura-kun, you've got some learning to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I learning?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.95,0:10:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawada, Iura-kun isn't {\i1}trying{\i0}\Nto scare you. He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.08,0:10:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't care if he's a good guy.\NThat's not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.83,0:10:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Iura-kun. No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand people\Nwho are loud and annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My throat's all scratchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You coming down with a cold, Iura?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.70,0:11:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep coughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel sick. I just can't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're acting\Nlike the same old Iura...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do feel... kinda fatigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally sick! Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.62,0:11:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, you've totally got a fever, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you grabbing me like this?!\NWhy're you grabbing me like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gentle with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My throat's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hurts that bad,\Nthen go the hell home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.87,0:11:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get anyone else sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Science Lab"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Going the same way so might as well help out,\Nbut can't say anything because his throat hurts"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Going the same way so might as well help out,\Nbut can't say anything because his throat hurts"\N"Terrified because someone just\Ngrabbed the box out of her hands"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Science Lab"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get anyone else sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You're so loud, Iura!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You're so loud, Iura!"\N"Nope!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You're so loud, Iura!"\N"Nope!"\N"He's scary!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I went home, gargled mouthwash\Nand passed out, and I'm feelin' great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Grats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.25,0:12:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At least say the whole word!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you congratulating me\Nfor beating a cold, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little sister's studying for high\Nschool exams. Don't get her sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawada-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need Iura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:13:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you think he's mad at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he even {\i1}get {\i0}mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.45,0:13:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--I've never seen him angry, ever.\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--I've never seen him angry, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"AND I MANAGED TO PISS HIM OFF!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,--I've never seen him angry, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"AND I MANAGED TO PISS HIM OFF!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, is he {\i1}really {\i0}mad at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, is he {\i1}really {\i0}mad at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear him laughing,\Nso I think you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want him to like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's Kono-san and Sawada-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miyamura's not here, but Hori-san is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you and Kono-san talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.91,0:13:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, if it's private,\Nyou don't have to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did everything work out yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, the science room is so far away\Nfrom the second-year classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried you'd end up late to class!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-You're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And she hates me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.20,0:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Iura-kun, your {\i1}timing {\i0}is annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My {\i1}timing{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.41,0:14:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, hmm... You want to try for East High?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.41,0:14:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,East High, huh. And you're dead set on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.16,0:14:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look. You might\Nwant to aim a rank lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grades are pretty average.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think your grades in any\Nsubject would be high enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.87,0:14:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not to say that's bad, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,East High, though... You may want\Nto think that over once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it some thought,\Nthen come back to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Moto-Moto. You know where Grampa is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.37,0:15:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna have dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I told my teacher where I wanted to go\Nfor high school, and he laughed at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does him laughing at you\Nmean you're not gonna eat dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to eat dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you wanna go, Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna laugh, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't. I wanna know\Nwhere you wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,East High.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I thought it was gonna be some\Nfunny name! That's not funny at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My teacher didn't laugh\Nat the name, dummy! He...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He laughed at my grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are they laughably bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always throwing your notes\Nand textbooks at me, so I took a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The pages of your textbooks are\Nworn down from how much you study.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You highlight and write\Nnotes all over them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Which teacher laughed at you? Bring 'im over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll punch his lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it so you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:17:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I try, but my grades keep slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My teacher said it's hopeless.\NHe said I should "rethink things."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends, they... Their grades are\Ngood enough to get in, but mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do, big bro?\NI don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I try, and I try, and I try,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The East High uniforms suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get in, you'll have\Nto try a lower-ranked school,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but you could totally get into Katagiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our uniforms are real cute.\NYou'd look good in 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do the best you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And eat your fill of dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hori-san, I've got a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Motoko-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Iu... er, your {\i1}brother {\i0}sent you over, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Head upstairs, the door\Nright at the top is my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on in and sit wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go get us some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess she's got two brothers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.83,0:19:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to tutor your\Nlittle sister? Me? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of. I just want you to see\Nif she could test into East High.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if that's all, then sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And if there's no way she'll get in,\NI want you to tell her straight out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.66,0:19:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just help her out a little,\Nat least till the exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.91,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked like a big brother there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You good with hot chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You look a lot like your brother.\NHas anyone ever told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.75,0:19:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose because both me and\Nmy brother are the quiet, brooding type.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The quiet, brooding type?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"The quiet, brooding type?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.95,0:19:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:20:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, brought my textbooks,\Nand my notes and stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.29,0:20:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's tough trying to study in\Na stranger's house right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just talk. You get the day off today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.79,0:20:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've relaxed a little,\Nwe can get to studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want more people to talk to,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can call in our resident high-school\Nand elementary-school boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro, who was that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Our friend's little sister, Motoko-chan.\NShe's here to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.16,0:20:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I've got banana cupcakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's show her we're rooting for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Middle schoolers\Nhave cell phones, now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, everyone has one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I don't have contact\Ninfo for much of my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:21:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I basically only text my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you two are close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We barely talk, and when I come home late,\Nhe just sends me an angry text. That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We could be in the same house\Nand he'll text me instead of talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}are {\i0}close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think he hates me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Lucky Charm"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.75,0:21:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Shu, what're you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one will make her\Npass the test for sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick it yourself, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just go with the biggest one, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, they're all the same size...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.08,0:21:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take the most expensive one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Guaranteed Exam Success"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That for your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If she wants it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.83,0:21:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You bought it for her, right?\NI'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.62,0:22:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.41,0:22:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...she doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...he doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Next Time: Hitherto, and Forevermore"
